{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Different trucks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Trucker Joe, you build up your own freight company. You start with an old, weak truck, but later on, with your hard-earned money, you can buy some seriously cool rigs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/Wheelloader.gif?t=1748974543\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You place the companies on the map!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You should strategically consider where to place each company to avoid unnecessary detours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/BuildMapNight.gif?t=1748974543\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Different companies require specialized trailers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every type of cargo needs the right trailer! Whether it's delivering heavy construction equipment or frozen pizza, you\u2019ll need the right trailer for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/MANFrigoNight.gif?t=1748974543\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2818630?t=1748974543","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/81629a210a9c5e245dc40d4952ebd7dc193f0cdf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748974543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/a2b19b101d4aacddd7905c27117e51795047156f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748974543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/a2b19b101d4aacddd7905c27117e51795047156f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748974543","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Different trucks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Trucker Joe, you build up your own freight company. You start with an old, weak truck, but later on, with your hard-earned money, you can buy some seriously cool rigs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/Wheelloader.gif?t=1748974543\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You place the companies on the map!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You should strategically consider where to place each company to avoid unnecessary detours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/BuildMapNight.gif?t=1748974543\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Different companies require specialized trailers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every type of cargo needs the right trailer! Whether it's delivering heavy construction equipment or frozen pizza, you\u2019ll need the right trailer for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/extras/MANFrigoNight.gif?t=1748974543\" /></p>","developers":["Sundrum Development"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818630/ee410a152919f35284ebafcd51bb5a10fcb4bb8a/header.jpg?t=1748974543","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117722,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117722/movie480.mp4?t=1747070411","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117722/movie_max.mp4?t=1747070411"},"name":"Gameplay Trucker Joe 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117722/9e47abfaa7512532b89fd564f725d4ad651fce60/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747070411","